      "properties": {
        "text": "# Masks and Blur\nAvoid modifying the masks inside the workflow, especially in cases of Inpainting + Detailing. Instead, modify the selection in Photoshop so that it enters the process with its gradients already applied. That way, the same mask that affects the inpainting is the one that will apply the transparency to the output that returns to Photoshop.",
        "targets": [
